  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Throw in a small amount of VRChat Credits each month with VRC+. Doesn't have to be a crazy amount, just enough so it stacks over a longer period of time, so you can support a creator every now and then.\n\nI think it would provide a range of positive outcomes:\n\n- Increased value of VRC+.\n\n- Player satisfaction.\n\n- Creator satisfaction.\n\nAnd most importantly imo:\n\n- Boosted VRC Credits / Creator Economy awareness and usage.\n\nExtra ideas:\n\n- Award the Credits only for playing the game consecutively - achieving streaks for logging e.g. no less than weekly. This could balance it a little bit more, for the potential cash \"lost\" on giving the credits away.",
